unded-xl py-3 font-semibold hover:scale-[1.02] transition shadow-lg shadow-rose-500/30\">Start 14-day free trial</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card reveal rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col\" style=\"transition-delay:.2s\">\n          <h3 class=\"font-display text-xl font-bold\">Family</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm mt-1\">Up to 6 people, one plan.</p>\n          <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-baseline gap-1\"><span class=\"font-display text-5xl font-bold\" id=\"famPrice\">$9.99</span><span class=\"text-zinc-500\">/month</span></div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-1 h-4\" id=\"famNote\">Billed monthly</p>\n          <ul class=\"mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-zinc-300 flex-1\">\n            <li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span class=\"text-emerald-400\">\u2713</span> Everything in Pro</li>\n            <li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span class=\"text-emerald-400\">\u2713</span> 6 individual accounts</li>\n            <li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span class=\"text-emerald-400\">\u2713</span> Shared family challenges</li>\n            <li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span class=\"text-emerald-400\">\u2713</span> Priority support</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#cta\" class=\"mt-8 text-center glass rounded-xl py-3 font-semibold hover:bg-white/10 transition\">Choose Family</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- FAQ -->\n  <section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-24\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4\">\n      <div class=\"text-center reveal\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-flame\">FAQ</p>\n        <h2 class=\"mt-3 font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight\">Questions? <span class=\"grad-text\">Answered.</span></h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt-12 space-y-3 reveal\">\n        <details class=\"card rounded-2xl p-6 group\" open>\n          <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-lg\">What happens if I miss a day?<span class=\"plus text-2xl text-flame\">+</span></summary>\n          <p class=\"mt-3 text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed\">No shame spirals here. If you have a Streak Freeze, it's used automatically. If not, your streak resets \u2014 but your longest streak and all your history stay safe, and we'll help you bounce back with a gentle \"comeback\" plan.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"card rounded-2xl p-6\">\n          <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-lg\">Is the free plan really free?<span class=\"plus text-2xl text-flame\">+</span></summary>\n          <p class=\"mt-3 text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed\">Yes \u2014 forever. Track up to 5 habits with streaks and reminders at no cost, no credit card required. Upgrade only if you want unlimited habits and the advanced features.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"card rounded-2xl p-6\">\n          <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-lg\">Does Streakly work on Android and web?<span class=\"plus text-2xl text-flame\">+</span></summary>\n          <p class=\"mt-3 text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed\">Streakly is available on iOS and Android, with a web dashboard and Apple Watch / Wear OS companions. Everything syncs instantly across your devices.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"card rounded-2xl p-6\">\n          <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-lg\">Is my data private?<span class=\"plus text-2xl text-flame\">+</span></summary>\n          <p class=\"mt-3 text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed\">Absolutely. Your data is encrypted in transit and at rest, we never sell it, and you can export or delete everything with a single tap.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"card rounded-2xl p-6\">\n          <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-lg\">Can I cancel anytime?<span class=\"plus text-2xl text-flame\">+</spa